TITLE Add H2SO4 in steps to pure water, report ionic strength
SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
REACTION 1 Add sulfuric acid
    H2SO4 1
    0.001 0.005 0.01 0.05 0.1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -step true
    -ionic_strength true
END
